{"id": "70524", "title": "军无戏言", "author": "盏茶", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 12, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70524/70524s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70524.htm", "intro": "“眼瞅着这个人利益与革命利益好不容易高度统一了，爷的终身大事也该提上日程了。”那人标志性的嘴角微扬，然而那俊逸的眉眼间却是说不出的郑重与认真：“作为一位人民解放军，我以生命向你起誓——爱你，军无戏言！”\n    所谓发小，所谓青梅竹马~谁说友情不能发展成奸情~~~\n    内容标签：都市情缘 情有独钟 高干", "base": "files/article/html/70/70524", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "10997435.html", "available": true}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10997436.html", "available": true}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10997437.html", "available": true}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10997438.html", "available": true}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10997439.html", "available": true}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10997440.html", "available": true}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10997441.html", "available": true}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10997442.html", "available": true}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10997443.html", "available": true}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10997444.html", "available": true}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "10997445.html", "available": true}, {"title": "56-58完结", "file": "10997446.html", "available": true}]}